{"id":"befo_rderung","lemma":"Beförderung","pos":"noun","rank":3591,"glosses":["transportation","promotion"],"ipa":"/bəˈfœrdərʊŋ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/31/De-Bef%C3%B6rderung.ogg/De-Bef%C3%B6rderung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Beförderung","plural":"Beförderungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Er verdient eine Beförderung.","en":"He deserves a promotion.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"deserved"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Meine Beförderung hängt von seiner Entscheidung ab.","en":"My promotion hangs on his decision.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null,{"g":"to hang","l":"hängen"},{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"his"},{"g":"decision"},{"g":"beginning at that time…"}]},{"text":"Sie verdienen eine Beförderung.","en":"You deserve to be promoted.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to make money, to earn"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Ich hätte diese Beförderung bekommern sollen.","en":"I should've gotten that promotion.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,null,{"g":"should"}]},{"text":"Er neidete seinem Freund die Beförderung.","en":"He was envious of his friend's promotion.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"friend"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}